== hdtvmate:
hdtvmate - native macOS driver for the GTMEDIA/Zenview HDTV Mate

Usage:
  HDTV Mate.app/Contents/Resources/driver/hdtvmate info                         init bridge + detect demod, then exit
  HDTV Mate.app/Contents/Resources/driver/hdtvmate scan [first] [last] [-1|-3]   scan US RF channels (default 2-36)
